    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Gem3F Tinker controls Watertrap Weaver (a Wizard), which means Chilling Trap would draw a card in addition to giving -4/-0. They could target an opponent's creature (like Brightmare) for the -4/-0 (irrelevant since it's sick) and draw a card for just {U} with 2 untapped Islands available. This is essentially a free cantrip that was passed up.",
      "action_taken": "Passed priority without casting Chilling Trap, missing a free card draw.",
      "better_line": "Cast Chilling Trap targeting opponent's Brightmare (or Celestial Enforcer) to draw a card for {U}, since Watertrap Weaver is a Wizard. The -4/-0 is irrelevant but the card draw is pure upside.",
